  "releaseNotes": "- Renamed 'assert' parameter in conversion functions (ToDouble(), ToInt(), ToDate(), ToDateTime(), ToString(), ToBoolean)) to throwOnError to avoid conflicts with assert operator (and also make the meaning more clear).\n              This is a breaking change only if there are existing JsonQL expressions that use named parameter 'assert' (e.g., ToBoolean(path, assert: true) in these functions. Otherwise, no changes to JsonQL expression if unnamed parameters are used with this functions (e.g., ToBoolean(path, true)).",
